			"notes": "## v1.0.78\n\n- New module: KnockbackDisplacer (Combat) — ported technique that displaces your aim while sprinting for strafe-style hits. Displacement angle and randomization settings included.\n- Fixed the release auto-updater: it now checks GitHub releases correctly (the repo is public, so no token needed).\n- Build now runs on GitHub Actions with Gradle 9.4.0; vendored cubiomes jars so builds no longer depend on the down maven.duti.dev server."
		},
